## 📈 성능 최적화

### 캐싱 헤더 설정 (Nginx)

```nginx
location ~* \.(js|css|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg|woff|woff2|ttf|eot)$ {
    expires 1y;
    add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
}

location ~* \.(html|json)$ {
    expires 1d;
    add_header Cache-Control "public, must-revalidate";
}
```

### Gzip 압축

```nginx
gzip on;
gzip_types text/plain text/css text/javascript application/json;
gzip_min_length 1000;
```

---

## 🔒 보안 설정

### SSL/TLS (HTTPS)

```bash
# Let's Encrypt 인증서 생성
sudo certbot certonly --standalone -d freelang.dclub.kr

# Nginx 설정에 추가
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/freelang.dclub.kr/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/freelang.dclub.kr/privkey.pem;
}
```

### IP 제한

```nginx
# 특정 IP만 접근 허용
allow 192.168.1.0/24;
deny all;
```

